sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as User / Browser
    participant API as NestJS AuthController
    participant Limiter as Redis RateLimiter
    participant Captcha as CaptchaService (Turnstile)
    participant Users as UsersService
    participant Audit as SecurityAuditService
    participant Mail as Mailpit SMTP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 15
    participant RBAC as PermissionEvaluator

    Note over Client, DB: 1. Registration with Turnstile Captcha
    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register (Email, Password, Turnstile Token)
    API->>Captcha: validateToken(turnstileToken)
    Captcha-->>API: Validated (OK)
    API->>Users: hashPassword(Argon2id)
    API->>DB: INSERT User (isActive = false, activationToken)
    API->>Mail: sendActivationEmail(activationLink)
    API-->>Client: 201 Created ("Check your email")

    Note over Client, DB: 2. Account Activation
    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/auth/activate?token=XYZ
    API->>DB: UPDATE User SET isActive = true, activationToken = NULL
    API-->>Client: 200 OK ("Account activated")

    Note over Client, DB: 3. Secure Login & 2FA Challenge
    Client->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login (Email, Password)
    API->>Limiter: checkRateLimit(email, ip)
    alt Account is Locked (5 failed attempts)
        Limiter-->>API: Locked (15-minute cooldown)
        API-->>Client: 429 Too Many Requests
    else Allowed Attempt
        API->>DB: SELECT User WHERE email = :email
        alt Account does not exist (Side-Channel Timing Defense)
            API->>Users: verifyPassword(DUMMY_ARGON2_HASH, password)
            API->>Limiter: incrementFailures(email)
            API-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized (Invalid credentials)
        else Account exists
            API->>Users: verifyPassword(user.passwordHash, password)
            alt Invalid Password
                API->>Limiter: incrementFailures(email)
                API->>Audit: recordFailure(email, ip, "BAD_CREDENTIALS")
                API-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
            else Valid Password & 2FA Enabled
                API->>Audit: recordChallenge(email, ip, "2FA_REQUIRED")
                API-->>Client: 200 OK { requires2FA: true, tempToken }
                Client->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/verify (tempToken, totpCode)
                API->>API: otplib.verify(totpCode, twoFactorSecret)
                API->>Limiter: clearFailures(email)
                API->>Audit: recordSuccess(email, ip, "LOGIN_SUCCESS")
                API-->>Client: 200 OK + Set-Cookie: access_token (15m), refresh_token (7d)
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Client, DB: 4. Protected API Access & RBAC Evaluation
    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/issues/:id (Cookie: access_token)
    API->>API: JwtAuthGuard validates JWT signature & expiration
    API->>RBAC: hasProjectPermission(userId, projectId, "BROWSE_PROJECTS")
    RBAC->>DB: Evaluate ProjectRoleActor, UserGroup, PermissionGrant
    RBAC-->>API: Access Granted (true)
    API->>DB: Evaluate issue_security_grants for user
    DB-->>API: Issue Record
    API-->>Client: 200 OK (Issue DTO)
